                                <strong>${isCorrect ? '✅ Correct' : '❌ Wrong'}</strong><br>
                                Your: Dr ${recorded ? recorded.debit : '—'} / Cr ${recorded ? recorded.credit : '—'}<br>
                                Correct: Dr ${t.correctDebit} / Cr ${t.correctCredit}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="explain-btn" onclick="showExplanation(${t.id}, ${isCorrect})">📖 Explanation</button>
                    </div>`;
                const div = document.createElement('div');
                div.innerHTML = html;
                container.appendChild(div.firstElementChild);
